So I'm just overlooking those issues

22:39.640 --> 22:42.040
and giving you the high level intuition.

22:42.040 --> 22:46.920
But from a practical standpoint, this is what you really need to know.

22:49.240 --> 22:54.280
Now fortunately, this least square problem has a closed form solution.

