but is almost free of tuning parameters. So I would say that if you are in a situation

59:35.980 --> 59:42.060
with a lot of outliers due to measurement noise or the environment that produces a lot of

59:42.060 --> 59:46.380
reflections for your layers so you get a lot of garbage, then RANSAC is the way to go.

59:46.380 --> 59:51.420
If you have anything clean environment, then QTransform deserves a try.

